(7599507, 1227494, 114285, '<td valign="top">I gave you six.  I feel the photo is probably a lot lower than it should be. I also think maybe the fact that you just plonked the pillows in middle of your mountain scene, seemed a little awkward.<br/> <br/> As far as the pillows go, they are just the best, I have one myself.</td>', 'I gave you six.  I feel the photo is probably a lot lower than it should be. I also think maybe the fact that you just plonked the pillows in middle of your mountain scene, seemed a little awkward.  As far as the pillows go, they are just the best, I have one myself.', '2018-10-26 01:14:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7599538, 1227437, 97225, '<td valign="top">Wow! Three blues in a row. Triple congrats, Judi. Great work.</td>', 'Wow! Three blues in a row. Triple congrats, Judi. Great work.', '2018-10-26 20:33:16.000000', NULL, 0),
